---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /
description: "Personal styling with a fresh approach. Halie blends vintage, high street, athletic, and custom pieces into a wardrobe that is unmistakably yours. Cincinnati and Northern Kentucky."
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">Personal styling · Cincinnati and Northern Kentucky</p>
      <h1>Be inspired by your own wardrobe.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Personal styling with a fresh approach. Halie blends vintage, high street, athletic, and custom pieces into looks that express who you already are, for women, men, and children.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="#contact">Book a consultation</a><a class="btn ghost" href="#services">How it works</a></div>
    </div>
    <img class="hero-img" src="/images/halie-column.jpg" alt="Halie, seated on a column in a navy blazer, burgundy shirt, and striped tie" width="1206" height="1509" fetchpriority="high">
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band-head"><h2>What it looks like to hire a personal stylist</h2></div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div><p class="num">01</p><h3>Consultation</h3><p>Narrow down your style goals and see how we can help.</p></div>
      <div><p class="num">02</p><h3>Wardrobe and color analysis</h3><p>Identify the gaps in what you own and discover what complements your features.</p></div>
      <div><p class="num">03</p><h3>Personalized selections</h3><p>Curated pieces just for you, drawn from vintage, high street, athletic, and custom.</p></div>
      <div><p class="num">04</p><h3>Coaching</h3><p>Learn how to mix, match, and unlock your confidence with guidance throughout.</p></div>
    </div>
    <p class="lede" style="margin-top:2.5rem">Styling for women, men, and children. Individuals going through life changes, athletes, and professionals from every industry.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band-head"><h2>Lookbook</h2><a class="textlink" href="/lookbook/">See all →</a></div>
    <div class="strip">
    {%- for l in looks.slice(0, 6) %}
      <a href="/lookbook/"><img src="{{ l.src }}" alt="{{ l.alt }}" width="{{ l.w }}" height="{{ l.h }}" loading="lazy"></a>
    {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" id="halie">
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <img src="/images/halie-lipstick.jpg" alt="Halie" width="1206" height="1506" loading="lazy">
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">CEO and chief stylist</p>
      <h2>Halie</h2>
      <p class="lede">Halie's passion for styling backs every aspect of The Urban Sophisticate Collective.</p>
      <p>She has worked with a wide variety of clients, including individuals going through life changes, athletes, and professionals from major industries. She has been collecting vintage and vinyl since 2008, and her taste brings a fresh perspective to the fashion industry.</p>
      <p>She is a Dalmatian gal and loves her pup, Oakley, named after the neighborhood in Cincinnati. She is a true foodie with a penchant for niche restaurants; ask her about styling and she may also point you to the best dinner in town.</p>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="#contact">Work with Halie</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band paper">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band-head"><h2>Notes</h2><a class="textlink" href="/notes/">All notes →</a></div>
    <div class="notes">
    {%- for n in notes.notes.slice(0, 3) %}
      <a class="note-card" href="/notes/{{ n.slug }}/">
        <img src="{{ n.image }}" alt="" loading="lazy">
        <p class="kicker">{{ n.kicker }}</p>
        <h3>{{ n.title }}</h3>
      </a>
    {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band dark" id="reels">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band-head"><h2>From the feed</h2><a class="textlink" href="{{ site.instagram }}">@urbansophisticatecollective</a></div>
    <div class="reels">
    {%- for r in reels %}
      <figure>
        <video controls preload="none" poster="{{ r.poster }}" playsinline><source src="{{ r.src }}" type="video/mp4"></video>
        <figcaption><strong>{{ r.title }}</strong><br>{{ r.note }}</figcaption>
      </figure>
    {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" id="contact">
  <div class="wrap two-col top">
    <div>
      <h2>Start with a conversation.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Tell Halie what you're dressing for and what isn't working. The consultation narrows your goals and shows how she can help.</p>
      <p>Or send a message on <a href="{{ site.instagram }}">Instagram</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <form class="form" action="https://formsubmit.co/{{ site.email }}" method="POST">
      <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Consultation request from the website">
      <label>Name <input type="text" name="name" required></label>
      <label>Email <input type="email" name="email" required></label>
      <label>I'm interested in
        <select name="service"><option>A consultation</option><option>Wardrobe and color analysis</option><option>Personalized selections</option><option>Styling for an event</option><option>Styling for my child</option><option>Something else</option></select>
      </label>
      <label>What are you dressing for? <textarea name="message" rows="4"></textarea></label>
      <button class="btn" type="submit">Send</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>
